@using BulletinBoard.Common
@using BulletinBoard.Enums
@using BulletinBoard.Helpers
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http
@using BulletinBoard.Services.Abstract
@inject IAuthService AuthService
@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.IHttpContextAccessor HttpContextAccessor

@{
    // ViewBag.Board가 있으면 게시판명을 상단 타이틀로 사용
    var boardTitle = (ViewBag.Board?.BoardName ?? ViewBag.Title ?? "ReplayBoard").ToString();
    var pageTitle = (ViewBag.Title ?? boardTitle ?? "ReplayBoard").ToString();
}

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>@pageTitle</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/replayboard.css" />
    @RenderSection("Head", required: false)
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrap">

        <header class="topbar">
            <div class="topbar-inner">
                <div class="brand">
                    <div class="brand-badge">📌</div>
                    <div>
                        <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.1;">@boardTitle</div>
                        <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:800;">ReplayBoard</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <nav class="actions">
                    @RenderSection("TopActions", required: false)
                </nav>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="container">
            @RenderBody()
        </main>

        <footer class="footer">
            © @DateHelper.GetKoreaNow().Year · ReplayBoard
        </footer>

    </div>

    @RenderSection("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>